    "physical_description": "Woman's longyi made of silk with a floating weft weave and unsewn. The ground of cloth consists of warp bands of pale green, pale pink and blue in regular sequence with alternate weft threads of pale green, pale pink and pale blue in regular sequence. The design, created by pink and green paired floating weft threads of acheik (horizontal wave patterns), run up the warp direction of the cloth.",
